# Pin this fixture to the conservative (low-width) e2e lane (zaplang-io/zap#1305).
# scope_cleanup exercises scope-exit cleanup ordering under the scheduler and is
# timing-sensitive, but its name carries no timeout/deadline/cancel marker that
# is_sensitive_name() keys on, so this `.serial` sidecar is the explicit escape
# hatch (same convention as .skip_arch). Content is ignored; existence is the signal.
